<title>THAILAND: General Finance pays 2 baht div for 1996.</title>
<headline>General Finance pays 2 baht div for 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dividend for year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>				Twelve months</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	  2.00	  vs	 3.00</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 March 5, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment Date	N.A.</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is General Finance and Securities Plc, a finance and securities firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
